{
  "version": "0.1.2",
  "slug": "checkbox",
  "title": "Checkbox",
  "group": "Selection",
  "order": 1,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A native checkbox with a drawn tick, for independent yes or no choices that are saved with a form. Several can be on at once; each label says what turning it on means.",
    "id": "Checkbox bawaan dengan centang yang digambar, untuk pilihan ya atau tidak yang saling lepas dan disimpan bersama formulir. Beberapa bisa menyala sekaligus; setiap label menyebut arti menyalakannya."
  },
  "titleId": "Checkbox",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Notification choices",
        "desc": "The tick draws in after a short delay; unticking erases it faster. The second line explains the consequence.",
        "html": "<fieldset class=\"stack\" style=\"border: 0;\">\n  <legend class=\"field__label\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">Email me when</legend>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path><path class=\"dash\" d=\"M3 7 L11 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"check__text\">My application status changes<small>As soon as an officer updates it</small></span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path><path class=\"dash\" d=\"M3 7 L11 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"check__text\">A deadline is 24 hours away</span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path><path class=\"dash\" d=\"M3 7 L11 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"check__text\">Someone replies to my report<small>At most one email a day</small></span></label>\n</fieldset>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Select all, with a mixed state",
        "desc": "When some but not all are on, the parent shows a dash and reports \"mixed\". Toggle the children to see it.",
        "html": "<div class=\"stack\">\n  <label class=\"check is-mixed\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ck-all\" onchange=\"const kids = [...document.querySelectorAll('#ck-kids input')]; kids.forEach((k) => (k.checked = this.checked)); this.closest('.check').classList.remove('is-mixed'); this.indeterminate = false;\"><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path><path class=\"dash\" d=\"M3 7 L11 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"check__text\">All documents</span></label>\n  <div class=\"stack\" id=\"ck-kids\" style=\"padding-left: 34px;\">\n    <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked onchange=\"const kids = [...document.querySelectorAll('#ck-kids input')], all = document.getElementById('ck-all'), n = kids.filter((k) => k.checked).length; all.checked = n === kids.length; all.indeterminate = n > 0 && n < kids.length; all.closest('.check').classList.toggle('is-mixed', all.indeterminate);\"><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path><path class=\"dash\" d=\"M3 7 L11 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"check__text\">KTP copy</span></label>\n    <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" onchange=\"const kids = [...document.querySelectorAll('#ck-kids input')], all = document.getElementById('ck-all'), n = kids.filter((k) => k.checked).length; all.checked = n === kids.length; all.indeterminate = n > 0 && n < kids.length; all.closest('.check').classList.toggle('is-mixed', all.indeterminate);\"><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path><path class=\"dash\" d=\"M3 7 L11 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"check__text\">Family card</span></label>\n    <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" onchange=\"const kids = [...document.querySelectorAll('#ck-kids input')], all = document.getElementById('ck-all'), n = kids.filter((k) => k.checked).length; all.checked = n === kids.length; all.indeterminate = n > 0 && n < kids.length; all.closest('.check').classList.toggle('is-mixed', all.indeterminate);\"><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path><path class=\"dash\" d=\"M3 7 L11 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"check__text\">RT cover letter</span></label>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<img alt=\"\" hidden src=\"data:,\" onerror=\"const a = document.getElementById('ck-all'); if (a) a.indeterminate = true;\">",
        "code": "<label class=\"check is-mixed\">\n  <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"all-documents\">\n  <span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path><path class=\"dash\" d=\"M3 7 L11 7\"></path></svg></span>\n  <span class=\"check__text\">All documents</span>\n</label>\n<script>document.getElementById('all-documents').indeterminate = true;</script>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Agreement and disabled",
        "desc": "A single checkbox before an important submit. A disabled option says why in its second line.",
        "html": "<div class=\"stack\">\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path><path class=\"dash\" d=\"M3 7 L11 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"check__text\">I have read the service terms<small>The data I send must match the original documents</small></span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path><path class=\"dash\" d=\"M3 7 L11 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"check__text\">Fill in from my previous application<small>Available once one of your applications is complete</small></span></label>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Pilihan notifikasi",
        "desc": "Centang tergambar setelah jeda singkat; menghapus centang menghilangkannya lebih cepat. Baris kedua menjelaskan akibatnya.",
        "html": "<fieldset class=\"stack\" style=\"border: 0;\">\n  <legend class=\"field__label\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">Kirimi saya email saat</legend>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path><path class=\"dash\" d=\"M3 7 L11 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"check__text\">Status permohonan berubah<small>Begitu petugas memperbaruinya</small></span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path><path class=\"dash\" d=\"M3 7 L11 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"check__text\">Batas waktu tinggal 24 jam</span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path><path class=\"dash\" d=\"M3 7 L11 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"check__text\">Ada balasan untuk laporan saya<small>Paling banyak satu email sehari</small></span></label>\n</fieldset>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pilih semua, dengan status campuran",
        "desc": "Saat sebagian tetapi tidak semua menyala, induknya menampilkan garis dan melaporkan \"campuran\". Ubah anak-anaknya untuk melihatnya.",
        "html": "<div class=\"stack\">\n  <label class=\"check is-mixed\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ck-all\" onchange=\"const kids = [...document.querySelectorAll('#ck-kids input')]; kids.forEach((k) => (k.checked = this.checked)); this.closest('.check').classList.remove('is-mixed'); this.indeterminate = false;\"><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path><path class=\"dash\" d=\"M3 7 L11 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"check__text\">Semua dokumen</span></label>\n  <div class=\"stack\" id=\"ck-kids\" style=\"padding-left: 34px;\">\n    <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked onchange=\"const kids = [...document.querySelectorAll('#ck-kids input')], all = document.getElementById('ck-all'), n = kids.filter((k) => k.checked).length; all.checked = n === kids.length; all.indeterminate = n > 0 && n < kids.length; all.closest('.check').classList.toggle('is-mixed', all.indeterminate);\"><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path><path class=\"dash\" d=\"M3 7 L11 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"check__text\">Fotokopi KTP</span></label>\n    <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" onchange=\"const kids = [...document.querySelectorAll('#ck-kids input')], all = document.getElementById('ck-all'), n = kids.filter((k) => k.checked).length; all.checked = n === kids.length; all.indeterminate = n > 0 && n < kids.length; all.closest('.check').classList.toggle('is-mixed', all.indeterminate);\"><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path><path class=\"dash\" d=\"M3 7 L11 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"check__text\">Kartu keluarga</span></label>\n    <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" onchange=\"const kids = [...document.querySelectorAll('#ck-kids input')], all = document.getElementById('ck-all'), n = kids.filter((k) => k.checked).length; all.checked = n === kids.length; all.indeterminate = n > 0 && n < kids.length; all.closest('.check').classList.toggle('is-mixed', all.indeterminate);\"><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path><path class=\"dash\" d=\"M3 7 L11 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"check__text\">Surat pengantar RT</span></label>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<img alt=\"\" hidden src=\"data:,\" onerror=\"const a = document.getElementById('ck-all'); if (a) a.indeterminate = true;\">",
        "code": "<label class=\"check is-mixed\">\n  <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"all-documents\">\n  <span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path><path class=\"dash\" d=\"M3 7 L11 7\"></path></svg></span>\n  <span class=\"check__text\">Semua dokumen</span>\n</label>\n<script>document.getElementById('all-documents').indeterminate = true;</script>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Persetujuan dan nonaktif",
        "desc": "Satu checkbox sebelum pengiriman penting. Opsi nonaktif menyebut alasannya di baris kedua.",
        "html": "<div class=\"stack\">\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path><path class=\"dash\" d=\"M3 7 L11 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"check__text\">Saya sudah membaca syarat layanan<small>Data yang dikirim harus sesuai dokumen asli</small></span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path><path class=\"dash\" d=\"M3 7 L11 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"check__text\">Ambil data dari permohonan sebelumnya<small>Tersedia setelah satu permohonan Anda selesai</small></span></label>\n</div>"
      }
    ]
  },
